WEBVTT

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:33.569
(Nature sounds)

00:05:33.593 --> 00:05:35.447
Well, a year later I returned,

00:05:35.471 --> 00:05:37.204
and using the same protocols

00:05:37.228 --> 00:05:39.919
and recording under the same conditions,

00:05:39.943 --> 00:05:42.147
I recorded a number of examples

00:05:42.171 --> 00:05:44.247
of the same dawn choruses,

00:05:44.271 --> 00:05:46.390
and now this is what we've got.

00:05:46.414 --> 00:05:47.670
This is after selective logging.

00:05:47.694 --> 00:05:49.980
You can see that the stream
is still represented

00:05:50.004 --> 00:05:51.650
in the bottom third of the page,

00:05:51.674 --> 00:05:56.153
but notice what's missing
in the top two thirds.

00:05:56.177 --> 00:06:01.666
(Nature sounds)